-- Sample listings so the map is not empty at launch: 20 in Tallinn and 10 in Tartu for each day.
-- Every id starts with 'sample-'. Remove them all with `npm run sample:remove`; the daily cron also
-- deletes them automatically two days before their date, so nobody walks to a house that isn't expecting them.
-- The edit_token_hash values are random, so nobody can edit these listings.
